{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13672","headline":"酬谢侍御喜王宇及第见贺不遇之作 · 严维","name":"酬谢侍御喜王宇及第见贺不遇之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寞柴门掩，经过柱史荣。\n老夫宁有力，半子自成名。\n柳映三桥发，花连上道明。\n缄书到别墅，郢曲果先成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13672.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13672","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}